<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-τόναιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretched</i> or
				<i>strained over</i>, esp. of <i>the membrane which contains
				the lower viscera</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ π. χιτῶνος ἢ ὑμένος ἢ
					σκεπάσματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			 :—freq. as Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτόναιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				18(1).164
			</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτόναιος</span></b> ,
				ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				4.1.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτόναιον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντερονεία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.92
			</span></i>, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίτονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			 ; but </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτόναια, τά</span>, <i>projecting beams at the stern</i> of a
			ship, ib.<i><span class="en">
				89
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
